00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.401
A firing squad

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.102
chief of

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:03.503
Russia's private army, Evgeny

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.838
Prigozhin, saying he's certain

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.573
there will be major Russian losses

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.041
on the battlefield in Ukraine

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.076
and the loss of territory inside Russia.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:11.311
And Prigozhin predicts

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:13.313
that those losses will be so significant,

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:15.482
the firing squads will be ordered

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:16.783
