00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:20.120
across a popular revolt

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.021
that will rise up over

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:23.390
the military's mistakes.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.058
Schedules made by Syria.

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:25.692
You upset with me?

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:26.393
With the Mujahidin,

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:28.962
we will now suffer serious losses

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.164
I am absolutely certain of it.

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.699
Now we are certainly losing

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:34.000
some Russian territory.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.536
This part being in the Russian Federation

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:38.705
would prevent

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.774
there will either be a popular revolt

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.842
or the State Duma will make a decision

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:44.577
for capital punishment

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.813
and given them the down.

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:49.582
And by the way, I can tell you honestly,

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.985
I think we're two to three months away

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:53.787
from the firing squads.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:56.923
This comes

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:59.159
as Ukrainians are making gains

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:01.127
around the key city of Berkeley.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:03.930
And Sam Kiley is OUTFRONT

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:06.633
Ukraine's third

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:08.201
assault brigade is in action

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:09.836
near Barmouth.

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.740
And they claim they're making advances

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.308
around the city,

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.843
but their attack is dependent

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:20.080
on soviet-era weapons.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.615
Modern equipment from the US and NATO

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:24.984
is apparently being held in reserve

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:27.287
for a Ukrainian offensive.

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:29.055
Do you have a name for your grant?

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:30.990
So what's offensive

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.826
Is it good enough for this fight?

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:33.526
The start and I

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.461
look at the list of choice.

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:35.595
Some of you saw

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:38.998
Ukraine gets no help at all

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:40.233
with aircraft.

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.868
Not so far.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:44.637
This SOVIET-ERA helicopter is ancient,

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:45.805
but in combat.

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:48.241
Almost every day

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:54.380
flying dangerously low to avoid missiles

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:58.318
and russian jet hunter killers

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.087
civil liberties are about to

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:01.855
start somewhere,

00:02:01.855 --> 00:02:03.923
but keep you mostly with. No, no.

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:05.992
Uh, you do say,

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:09.062
uh, non-nuclear thought.

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:10.463
The one if principle

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:11.698
that was an idea was in it.

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:14.100
These aircraft

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.635
will fly more sorties

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:18.004
as fighting intensifies

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:21.641
in a relentless cycle of war.

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.910
Ukraine has now got added rage

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:26.846
at what it's calling a Russian ecocide.

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:29.349
This part of Kherson has suffered

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:30.750
Russian bombardment

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.486
across the river for months now, near

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.922
total destruction from up river

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:37.857
Russia is widely

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:39.792
blamed for the collapse of the dam

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.261
at Novakovic,

00:02:41.261 --> 00:02:42.795
which has been under its control

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:45.031
since March last year.

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:46.199
Civilians who survived

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:48.434
the Russian occupation of their town

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:50.336
and an offensive to free it

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.906
are now facing down a new horror.

00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:56.042
Thousands have no drinking water here

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:57.977
a drone delivers help,

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.380
an adaptation of a system

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.916
originally designed not to save life,

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:05.251
but to take it

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:08.955
now.

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:10.557
And these recent successes

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:12.025
that the Ukrainians are claiming

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:14.661
may well be in part as a consequence

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:17.730
of effectively mutinous behavior by Mr.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.631
Prigozhin, who

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.733
just the other day captured

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:22.335
the commander

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:24.304
of the 72nd mechanized brigade,

00:03:24.304 --> 00:03:25.238
a Russian brigade,

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:26.706
the neighboring unit

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:29.909
to Wagner in Vermont, beat him up,

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:31.611
forced him into

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:33.279
an online confession

00:03:33.279 --> 00:03:33.613
in which

00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:35.848
he was told to say that he'd been drunk

00:03:36.082 --> 00:03:36.583
and opened

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:37.650
fire on Wagner

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.286
troops It's just that kind of collapse of

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:41.487
law and order

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:42.622
within the Russian ranks

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:43.356
that the Ukrainians

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:45.525
be absolutely delighted by

00:03:45.525 --> 00:03:46.259
if you couldn't,

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:47.961
if that didn't exist,

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:48.895
I think the Ukrainians

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:50.463
would have wanted to make him up.

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:51.097
Erin?

00:03:51.097 --> 00:03:53.433
Yeah, I mean, it it it is unbelievable.

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:54.300
It defies belief.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:54.601
All right.

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:55.735
Thank you very much, Sam

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:57.503
reporting live from Kiev tonight.

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:58.838
And let's go now to the former U.S.

00:03:58.838 --> 00:04:00.640
ambassador to Russia, John Sullivan.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:01.708
And Ambassador Sullivan.

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:02.775
I'm so glad to have you back.

00:04:02.775 --> 00:04:03.977
So, you know,

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:05.445
Sam is talking about the Russians.

00:04:05.445 --> 00:04:07.213
Do they have control of that dam?

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:07.480
In fact,

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:09.315
they have had control of that dam

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:10.383
for months.

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:11.851
And now they haven't provided

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:13.119
a single shred of evidence,

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:14.921
but they are keeping up a narrative

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:17.023
that it is Ukraine's fault.

00:04:17.357 --> 00:04:18.658
This does seem absurd.

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:20.526
It seems to defy credulity, does it?

00:04:21.828 --> 00:04:23.229
Absolutely, Erin.

00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:25.064
And you hit the nail on the head.

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:27.033
They're in control of this dam

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:28.501
because they invaded

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:31.471
Ukraine in February of 20, 22.

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:32.872
This war would end.

00:04:32.872 --> 00:04:35.341
There would be no dam collapse

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:38.011
if the Russians hadn't invaded Ukraine.

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:40.613
It's ultimately Russia's fault.

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:42.782
So you obviously saw Putin.

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:43.449
You knew him up

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:45.451
close as ambassador to Russia.

00:04:45.451 --> 00:04:46.819
So better than anyone.

00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:48.454
You have a sense of how he operates, how

00:04:48.454 --> 00:04:49.555
he thinks.

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:52.125
You've got a counteroffensive now,

00:04:52.191 --> 00:04:54.861
seemingly in full swing.

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:57.764
You have attacks on Russian territory.

00:04:57.764 --> 00:04:58.931
You've got Prigozhin

00:04:58.931 --> 00:05:00.733
saying all sorts of things.

00:05:00.733 --> 00:05:03.436
What is Putin's mindset like right now?

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:06.639
As best as you can imagine?

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:09.008
Well, I think from his background

00:05:09.008 --> 00:05:09.842
in his training,

00:05:09.842 --> 00:05:12.645
going all the way back to his KGB days,

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:14.080
he would never show it.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.581
The more difficult it gets,

00:05:16.683 --> 00:05:17.984
the cooler and calmer he

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:19.452
will try to appear.

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:21.187
But he is under enormous stress.

00:05:21.187 --> 00:05:22.188
Now, Erin, there's

00:05:22.188 --> 00:05:23.723
there's no doubt about that.

00:05:23.723 --> 00:05:26.125
Secretary Blinken recited in a speech

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:28.094
last week in Helsinki

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:31.097
how this war has been a strategic

00:05:31.097 --> 00:05:33.966
catastrophe for Putin and Russia.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.702
And day by day,

00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:38.071
whether it's the dam collapse,

00:05:38.071 --> 00:05:40.173
whether it's Prigozhin, the head of

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:42.842
as you accurately described it, Putin's

00:05:42.875 --> 00:05:44.210
private army,

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.445
talking about senior

00:05:45.445 --> 00:05:47.547
Russian generals being executed.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.450
This is calamitous for Russia

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.851
and for Putin.

00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:53.453
And let's talk more about what

00:05:53.453 --> 00:05:54.387
Prigozhin said. Right.

00:05:54.387 --> 00:05:56.189
He predicted those firing squads

00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:56.723
in Russia

00:05:56.723 --> 00:05:57.824
within two to three months,

00:05:57.824 --> 00:05:59.659
which would target Russia's top generals,

00:05:59.659 --> 00:06:00.893
Putin's generals.

00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:02.995
He also suggested Putin might detonate

00:06:02.995 --> 00:06:06.199
a nuclear weapon in Russia, in Belgorod.

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:08.101
I don't know

00:06:08.101 --> 00:06:09.435
whether it's a false flag or what,

00:06:09.435 --> 00:06:10.436
but he said that

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:12.872
he's claimed to take a Russian commander,

00:06:13.339 --> 00:06:14.974
