00:06:14.974 --> 00:06:16.175
as a P.O.W..

00:06:16.175 --> 00:06:17.410
I mean, this seems to be reaching

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.178
some sort of a breaking pit

00:06:19.178 --> 00:06:21.781
breaking point, even for someone

00:06:21.781 --> 00:06:23.583
who's actions and words

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:24.884
have frankly been been

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:26.452
quite shocking for a long time.

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:28.921
They have been there.

00:06:28.921 --> 00:06:29.555
And it's just

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:33.092
it's it's a a growing cascade

00:06:33.092 --> 00:06:37.263
of crazy statements by Prigozhin.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:38.931
I mean, months ago,

00:06:38.931 --> 00:06:41.300
